# Online in the Humanities: Problems and Possibilities.

**Authors:** Stern, Peter

## Abstract
Description of problems that have hindered the development and use of online databases in the humanities focuses primarily on history. The discussion covers vocabulary difficulties, lack of retrospective information, attitudes of humanities scholars toward technology, and lack of funding. Some suggestions for meeting the needs of historians are offered. (26 references) (CLB)

